@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+The runtime creates this agent through `createOrderTriageAgent` in `/src/order-triage-agent.ts`. It must provide the factory with an asynchronous loader that resolves the requested repository-absolute canonical instruction path. The factory awaits that loader and exposes its returned text as the agent instruction.
+
+The created agent identifies itself as `order-triage`, reports the action `classify-for-human-review`, and exposes `canApproveRefunds` as `false`.
